["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>You have a rifle for deer and a .22 for grouse. The shotgun is for ducks, geese and flushing grouse. Buy the one that fits you and runs heavy steel, not the one with the best ad.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Which shotgun first: ducks and geese with heavy steel loads point to a gas semi auto. Tight budget and simple care point to a pump. Mostly grouse and clay targets, and money for it, point to an over under.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Which action first?</text>\n<rect x=\"70\" y=\"44\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"70.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What will you hunt most?</text>\n<line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"74.1\" y2=\"118.4\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M68.0 120.0 L74.9 114.2 L76.8 121.8Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<rect x=\"4\" y=\"124\" width=\"128\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"68.0\" y=\"150.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ducks, geese</text>\n<text x=\"68.0\" y=\"182.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Gas semi auto</text>\n<line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"113.7\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M200.0 120.0 L196.1 111.9 L203.9 111.9Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<rect x=\"136\" y=\"124\" width=\"128\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"150.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tight budget</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"182.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pump</text>\n<line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"325.9\" y2=\"118.4\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M332.0 120.0 L323.2 121.8 L325.1 114.2Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<rect x=\"268\" y=\"124\" width=\"128\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<text x=\"332.0\" y=\"150.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Grouse, clays</text>\n<text x=\"332.0\" y=\"182.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Over under</text>\n<text x=\"68.0\" y=\"206.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">my lean</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One 12 gauge, 3 inch, chokes, steel rated.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"288.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Price checked 2026-10-23.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Assumption: ducks and geese near Mission are the main job; grouse second.</li><li>Assumption: one gun for both, bought new or lightly used, this season.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what this owner needs (from the app so far)</summary><ul><li>You hunt with your brother, from a blind, a field and sometimes a small boat (from the duck and geese Masterclasses).</li><li>That means steel shot, a 3 in chamber, screw in chokes rated for steel, and a plug (99% on the law, Tip on the rest).</li><li>The app's earlier pick is the same: one 12 gauge, 3 in chamber, screw in chokes, a gas semi auto as the softest with heavy steel (70%, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide/0\">Choosing your shotgun</a>).</li><li>Budget: about $10,000 for all gear was noted earlier (from PLAN.md). How much of that is left for a shotgun: owner question.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Pros</th><th>Cons</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gas semi auto (Beretta A300)</td><td>Softest recoil with heavy steel. Factory 3 shell reducer</td><td>More parts to clean. Gas parts must stay clean</td></tr><tr><td>Inertia semi auto (Stoeger M3000)</td><td>Runs clean. Cheaper</td><td>Sharper recoil. Needs real loads to cycle</td></tr><tr><td>Pump (Benelli Nova, Remington 870)</td><td>Cheapest. Cycles any load. Simple</td><td>Most recoil. Short stroking under stress</td></tr><tr><td>Over under (Browning Citori)</td><td>Safest to show empty. Two chokes</td><td>Two shots. Costs more. Check steel rating</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","<aside class=\"callout lean\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">My lean (opinion)</div><p>My lean: a <strong>Beretta A300 Outlander</strong>, 12 gauge, 3 in, 28 in barrel. Gas softens 3 in steel, it ships with steel proof chokes and a 2 shell reducer, and the manual is clear. Budget pick: <strong>Stoeger M3000</strong> (inertia). Try both on the same day. Your call.</p></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why each, with sources</summary><ul><li>A300: gas system that vents excess pressure, \"Every A300 Outlander has been tested with special proof test ammunition at 1320 bar with steel shot,\" steel proof Mobilchoke tubes, factory reducer to 3 shots (95%, Beretta manual).</li><li>A300 watch out: the 2011 manual says not to use European \"High Performance\" steel loads with pellets over 3.5 mm. BB is 4.57 mm. <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> with Beretta Canada which goose loads suit an A300 before you buy BB.</li><li>M3000: inertia, minimum 1 oz 3 dram loads, plug installed from the factory, full and improved modified not recommended with steel (95%, Stoeger manual).</li><li>Pump: reliable and cheap, kicks hardest (70%, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide/2\">Choosing your shotgun</a>).</li><li>Over under: weak as a one gun for ducks plus upland; check the steel rating (65%, same lesson).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Price tiers for a new 12 gauge in Canada, checked 23 October 2026: entry pumps and inertia semi autos about 630 to 890 dollars; mid gas semi autos about 1,120 to 1,525 dollars; premium semi autos and over unders about 2,300 to 3,000 dollars and up.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">What it costs (CAD)</text>\n<line x1=\"40\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"40.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$0</text>\n<line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"140.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$1,000</text>\n<line x1=\"240.0\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"240.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"240.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$2,000</text>\n<line x1=\"340.0\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"340.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"340.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$3,000</text>\n<text x=\"40.0\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Entry</text>\n<text x=\"97.4\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">pump, inertia</text>\n<rect x=\"103\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"135.0\" y=\"83.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">$630 to $890</text>\n<text x=\"40.0\" y=\"118.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Mid</text>\n<text x=\"77.5\" y=\"118.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">gas semi auto</text>\n<rect x=\"152\" y=\"126\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<text x=\"198.5\" y=\"141.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">$1,120 to $1,525</text>\n<text x=\"40.0\" y=\"176.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Premium</text>\n<text x=\"120.3\" y=\"176.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">semi, over under</text>\n<rect x=\"270\" y=\"184\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<text x=\"263.5\" y=\"199.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">$2,295 to $3,020</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Price checked 2026-10-23. Verify in store.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>CAD (Canadian dollars), new, price checked 2026-10-23 at one Canadian retailer <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Prices move. Check two stores before you buy (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the tiers in full</summary><h3>Entry</h3><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Action</th><th>CAD</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stoeger P3500 Max 7</td><td>Pump, 3 1/2 in</td><td>$630</td><td>Rangeview, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Stoeger M3000</td><td>Inertia semi auto</td><td>$725 to $890</td><td>Rangeview, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Benelli Nova 3, 26 in</td><td>Pump</td><td>$805</td><td>Rangeview, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Remington 870 Fieldmaster</td><td>Pump</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td>No Canadian new price found</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Mid</h3><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Action</th><th>CAD</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Beretta A300 Outlander</td><td>Gas semi auto</td><td>$1,117 to $1,349</td><td>App, 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Beretta A300 Ultima</td><td>Gas semi auto</td><td>$1,400 to $1,525</td><td>Rangeview, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Winchester SX4 Waterfowl</td><td>Gas semi auto</td><td>$1,367 to $1,570</td><td>App, 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Premium</h3><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Action</th><th>CAD</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Beretta A400 Xtreme Plus</td><td>Gas semi auto, 3 1/2 in</td><td>$2,515 to $2,760</td><td>Rangeview, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Benelli Super Black Eagle 3</td><td>Inertia semi auto</td><td>$2,295 to $2,900</td><td>App, 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Browning Citori Hunter Grade I</td><td>Over under</td><td>$2,945 to $3,020</td><td>Rangeview, special order, 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Used examples at the same store, 2026-10-23: Remington 870 Magnum $560, Stoeger M3000 $710 to $740 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Premium buys finish, softer recoil and resale. It does not buy more ducks (Tip).</li><li>Budget about $150 to $300 more for a lock, case, ear and eye protection, chokes and the first shells (Tip, <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> at the store).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fit check in the store: 1 wear your hunting jacket, 2 mount with eyes closed, open them: you should look straight down the rib, 3 length of pull: the butt sits in the shoulder pocket without stretching, 4 try 3 guns, 10 mounts each.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Fit check in the store</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"48\" width=\"376\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"77.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"69.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hunting jacket on</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">It changes length of pull</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"104\" width=\"376\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"133.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"125.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Eyes shut, mount, open</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"142.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Straight down the rib?</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"160\" width=\"376\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"184.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"189.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"181.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Length of pull</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"198.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Shoulder pocket, no stretch</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"216\" width=\"376\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"237.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">3 guns, 10 mounts each</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"254.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Pick the one that points itself</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Wear your hunting jacket. Eyes shut, mount, open: straight down the rib (Tip).</li><li>Pattern the gun you buy at 35 m before the hunt (<a href=\"#/s/mc-shotgun-06\">Chapter 6</a>).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: fit in full</summary><ul><li>LOP (length of pull) is trigger to the end of the stock. Most adults need about 14 to 14.75 in (65%, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide/7\">Choosing your shotgun</a>).</li><li>The A300 Outlander ships set for a right handed shooter with 55 or 60 mm drop; spacers and a plate change drop and cast. Beretta: that change \"must be carried out by a competent gunsmith\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Ask the shop to let you mount 3 guns 10 times each. The one that points where you look wins (Tip).</li><li>A shooting club or clays range may let you try guns before you buy: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> with a local club.</li><li>Left eye dominant and right handed? Find out first: <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-mastery/12\">Shotgun mastery</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Used shotgun checks: 1 seller shows it unloaded and you prove it, 2 bores clean, no pits, bulges or dents, 3 chokes come out, threads clean, 4 action cycles smooth, 5 for gas guns piston and seal present, for over unders the action closes tight, 6 plug and choke wrench included, 7 PAL check and the transfer reference number.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Buying used: 7 checks</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"59.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Prove it unloaded</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"79\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"94.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"99.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"99.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Bores: no pits, bulges</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"114\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"129.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"134.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"134.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Chokes come out</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"149\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"164.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Action cycles smooth</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"184\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"199.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Gas parts / tight hinge</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"219\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"234.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"239.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"239.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Plug and wrench in box</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"254\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"269.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"274.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"274.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">PAL and reference number</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Seller shows it unloaded; you prove it too <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><ul><li>If in doubt, pay a gunsmith to look before you pay the seller (Tip).</li></ul>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"sg2-used-check\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:0\"><span>Seller opens it. I prove it unloaded myself</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:1\"><span>Bores from both ends: no rust, pits, bulges or dents</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:2\"><span>Choke tubes come out with the wrench; threads clean</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:3\"><span>Choke wrench and the tubes come with it</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:4\"><span>Action cycles 10 times, smooth, no grinding</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:5\"><span>Pump: fore end locks and unlocks. Semi auto: piston, seal, recoil spring present</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:6\"><span>Over under: opens and closes firmly, top lever snaps back</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:7\"><span>Plug present</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:8\"><span>Stock and recoil pad not cracked; barrel stamp readable</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:9\"><span>Serial number present</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"sg2-used-check:10\"><span>PAL (Possession and Acquisition Licence) checked; seller gets a reference number</span></label></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the law on a private sale</summary><ul><li>For a private sale of a non restricted firearm, the seller must get a reference number from the Registrar of Firearms (RCMP Canadian Firearms Program) before the transfer; you give the seller your licence details so they can ask (99%, <a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/F-11.6/section-23.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firearms Act s. 23</a>, via <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide/9\">Choosing your shotgun</a>).</li><li>PAL means Possession and Acquisition Licence. You need yours to buy any firearm <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Home storage: unloaded, locked or bolt out or in a locked container, ammunition not readily at hand unless locked too (99%, <a href=\"#/s/firearm-care/13\">Firearm care</a>).</li><li>Never buy a cut down shotgun: under 457 mm barrel or 660 mm overall can be a prohibited firearm (99%, <a href=\"#/s/mc-shotgun-01/6\">Chapter 1</a>).</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout warn\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What to buy with the shotgun: 1 a lock or locked case for storage and transport, 2 steel shot rated chokes, improved cylinder and modified, 3 ear and eye protection, 4 a box of target loads plus the hunting shells you will pattern, 5 a cleaning kit, 6 a soft or hard case.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Buy with the gun</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"61.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"66.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"58.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Lock or locked case</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Storage rules apply at home</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"84\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"101.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"106.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"98.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Chokes: IC and modified</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"115.5\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Steel rated</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"124\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"141.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"146.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"146.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Ear and eye protection</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"164\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"181.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"186.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"178.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Target loads plus hunt shells</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"195.5\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Pattern the hunt shells</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"204\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"221.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"226.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"226.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Cleaning kit</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"244\" width=\"376\" height=\"35\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"261.5\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"266.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"266.5\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Case for transport</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Lock or locked case, steel rated chokes, ear and eye protection (Tip).</li><li>Two boxes of your duck shell to pattern before you buy a case of it (Tip).</li></ul>","<aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Buy the gun that fits, not the gun that wins the magazine test.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Buying online without ever mounting the gun.</li><li>A 3 1/2 in magnum \"for geese\" that you then flinch with all season.</li><li>A cheap used gun with a seized choke and no plug.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Shop on a weekday morning, in your hunting jacket. Mount the A300 and the M3000 side by side, ask about the plug and the chokes in the box, then go pattern before the opener.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Maker manuals <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Law via the app <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Prices from one retailer page <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span> and the app's 2026-10-01 check <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://berettaweb.com/Munuals/Beretta%20Owner%20Manual%20A300%20Outlander%20LD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Beretta A300 Outlander instruction manual, 09/2011</a>: steel proof, reducer, HP caution, stock drop and cast. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://debug.stoegerindustries.com/sites/default/files/content/media/manuals/2021-12/m3000_owners_manual.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stoeger M3000 owner's manual</a>: minimum load, plug, chokes. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li>Rangeview Sports (Canadian retailer) search pages for Stoeger, M3000, Benelli, A300, Citori, Remington 870: <a href=\"https://rangeviewsports.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">rangeviewsports.ca</a>, read through a page reader 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span></li><li><a href=\"#/s/shotgun-guide\">Choosing your shotgun</a>: 2026-10-01 prices <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>, fit and action pros and cons (65 to 70%)</li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/F-11.6/section-23.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firearms Act s. 23</a>, via the app <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/C-46/section-84.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Criminal Code, s. 84</a>, read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li></ul></details>"]